    "bonus": "5000",
    "reason": "Situation & Task: For sellers already winning on TTS, expanding globally through TTS is the next growth path. The project aimed to build a stable cross-region mechanism that channels content-capable, US-proven sellers into EU12, UK and JP, expanding TTS's overall share of seller wallet. \nAction:\nCross-region pairing: Paired seven US industry teams with their EU counterparts, with weekly tracking and escalation to drive continuous improvement.\nIssue-to-policy loop: Distilled 26 recurring EU-entry pain points into 3 root categories and 3 policy upgrades.\nResult:\nUS top-tier (T5) pool: new-market sellable rate 32% → 61%, outreach coverage 52% → 100%.\nOn track to attract T3/T4 sellers in Q3; Sellable HIPO projected to double vs. 2025.\nCross-region information routing upgraded, enabling two-way seller expansion in Q4.",
