    "bonus": "5000",
    "reason": "EMEA Live Auction brought a new Live commerce format to EU and UK markets in H1 2026, moving from zero baseline to rapid scaling within two quarters and establishing auction as a new growth driver for Live in EMEA.\nThe impact was visible across the region. In both markets, auction GMV quickly grew to account for a meaningful share of total Live GMV and became a significant driver of overall GMV growth, with month-over-month growth accelerating sharply through Q2. The auction model also proved more efficient than standard Live across key metrics — GMV per hour, orders per hour, GPM and conversion rate — pointing to a format that delivers not just incremental volume but higher-quality growth.\nBehind this was close collaboration across functions like strategy, BPO, operations, Product, GnE and etc. From benchmark research and target merchant mapping to product alignment and market execution, teams worked across compliance, payments, seller fulfilment and rollout needs to enable simultaneous launch and rapid iteration in both markets — turning auction from an early strategic priority into a repeatable operating model for regional growth.",
