  {
    "project_name": "EU8 New Market Launch",
    "department": "EU Ops",
    "region": "EU",
    "original_region": "EU",
    "bonus": "5000",
    "reason": "EU8 Market Launch completed TikTok Shop Europe’s largest single-wave market expansion to date, with eight markets launched in parallel across Poland, the Netherlands, Belgium, Czech Republic, Austria, Greece, Portugal and Hungary. The project required close collaboration across Product, Operations, GNE, Logistics, UG, Data Science, Data/Algo, PIPO, Tech, Design, Legal and Compliance to align localisation, onboarding, payments, logistics and governance into one coordinated launch approach.\nBeyond the scale of expansion, the project showed disciplined execution under complexity. Cross-functional teams worked through a shared mechanism to improve coordination, manage dependencies and resolve issues quickly. During UAT, all identified issues were resolved on time, and no P0 issue occurred during Pilot, supporting a stable and controlled rollout across markets.\nThe project also delivered clear early business results. C-side daily GMV reached 430% of target, launch-day GMV reached 625% of target, and long-tail markets achieved 139% of GMV target despite having no local merchant supply. EU8 also provided a more repeatable model for future multi-market launches, showing how teams can expand at pace while staying aligned on quality, readiness and execution.",
